cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this catalog or software, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "FBLS: Preliminary Catalog of Exoplanet Transit Candidates Identified in TESS Photometry"
authors:
  - family-names: "Ruas"
    given-names: "Isak Paulo de Andrade"
    affiliation: "NROLABS"
repository-code: "https://github.com/isakruas/fbls"
version: v2026-11-06
date-released: 2026-11-06
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - TESS
  - exoplanets
  - transit search
  - planet candidates
  - CTOI
abstract: >-
  Transit candidates from a blind GPU search (FBLS) of TESS 2-minute SPOC light curves,
  with automated vetting, difference-image pixel tests and TRICERATOPS false positive
  probabilities. Each release holds the cumulative catalog (paper/deposit/<day>/: ctoi.csv,
  candidates.csv, figures.zip, ReadMe.txt) together with the code that produced it.
